      </div>
      <p>
        요구사항과 현행 환경을 분석해 최적의 구성을 설계하고,
        검증된 절차로 구축한 뒤 안정적인 운영까지 지원합니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="home-infra-grid">
      <a class="home-infra-card" href="{{ '/it-infra/' | url }}">
        <span class="home-infra-card__number">01</span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__media">
          <img src="{{ '/images/photo/infra/graph_consulting.png' | url }}"
               alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__body">
          <strong>Consulting</strong>
          <span>현재 환경과 목표를 분석해 실행 가능한 인프라 전략을 제안합니다.</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-infra-card" href="{{ '/it-infra/build/' | url }}">
        <span class="home-infra-card__number">02</span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__media">
          <img src="{{ '/images/photo/infra/graph_build.png' | url }}"
               alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__body">
          <strong>IT Infra 구축</strong>
          <span>서버·스토리지·네트워크를 업무 환경에 맞게 설계하고 구축합니다.</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-infra-card" href="{{ '/it-infra/maintenance/' | url }}">
        <span class="home-infra-card__number">03</span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__media">
          <img src="{{ '/images/photo/infra/graph_maintenance.png' | url }}"
               alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="home-infra-card__body">
          <strong>Maintenance</strong>
          <span>예방 점검과 신속한 장애 대응으로 안정적인 운영을 지킵니다.</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

