        <span class="home-product__media">
          <img src="{{ '/images/photo/product/lenovo/x86/sr650.png' | url }}"
               alt="Lenovo ThinkSystem SR650 서버" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="home-product__copy">
          <strong>x86 Server</strong>
          <span>유연한 확장성과 효율적인 운영을 위한 엔터프라이즈 서버</span>
        </span>
        <span class="home-product__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>

      <a class="home-product" href="{{ '/products/dell/x86-server/' | url }}">
        <span class="home-product__vendor">Dell</span>
        <span class="home-product__media">
          <img src="{{ '/images/photo/product/dell/x86/r740.png' | url }}"
               alt="Dell PowerEdge R740 서버" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </span>
        <span class="home-product__copy">
          <strong>PowerEdge Server</strong>
          <span>다양한 워크로드에 대응하는 고성능 데이터센터 플랫폼</span>
        </span>
        <span class="home-product__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="home-products-more">
      <a class="home-arrow-link home-arrow-link--light" href="{{ '/products/' | url }}">
        전체 제품군 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

